{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI近日宣佈，已在內部研究基礎設施中部署名為「Control Room」的中央控制系統。當模型任務引發安全或網絡安全風險時，<strong>該系統可在收到停止指令後最長35秒內阻斷模型繼續輸出</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585728.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.126448+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:23:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"dee5b69daa3f1f6205784e07e411504f139f34151327ee5debcc45693e2e4070","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}